  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kuali Fund - India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Kuali will foster adoption of climate best practices by Financial Service Providers (FSPs). It will support FSPs in their transition to become greener and more inclusive so that they eventually provide green products. to SMEs and small holders. Kuali will also support companies with innovative climate solutions to expand the number of available mitigation and adaptation solutions that could eventually be financed by FSPs.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
